                  "description": "(Required) <p>The name of the IAM role for which you want to see the list of tags.</p> <p>This parameter accepts (through its <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/regex\">regex pattern</a>) a string of characters that consist of upper and lowercase alphanumeric characters with no spaces. You can also include any of the following characters: _+=,.@-</p>"
